    <!-- ═══ Disclaimer ═══ -->
    <string name="disclaimer_title">Warning!</string>
    <string name="disclaimer_subtitle">You\'re about to enter a war zone.</string>
    <string name="disclaimer_body">This app lets you send LOUD notifications to your friends, capable of bypassing the ringer volume and Do Not Disturb mode on their phone.\n\nYes, you read that right. Even at 3 in the morning. Even during a meeting with the boss. Even while they\'re asleep.\n\nDon\'t worry, there\'s \"Zen Mode\" to keep you safe when you\'ve had enough. But remember: if you use it too much, your friends will think you\'re a coward.\n\nUse it at your own risk. We take no responsibility for ruined friendships, phones thrown off balconies, or furious colleagues.</string>
    <string name="disclaimer_accept">Got it!</string>

